{"articleNo":"309602","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=309602&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [대학혁신지원사업] 소규모 학습법 워크숍 신청 안내(추가 모집)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.05.21","hit":"5678","attachments":[{"name":"2021-1학기 소규모 학습법 워크숍 운영 안내(추가 모집).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=309602&attachNo=100371"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHoQVkhzAXgcQM4CUCCzEGMAyAZgB4CuAtgFKIBCAGgOqUB0AVgA7xA%20\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">소규모 학습법 워크숍은 사전에 학습유형검사 실시 후 2일간 총 6시간 진행되는 프로그램입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">* 혜택: 마일리지 부여, 수료증, 버거 제공 </span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255);\">5/26(수), 6/2(수) 10시~13시 이틀간 모두 참여 가능한 학생만 신청 바랍니다.</span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -0.8pt; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-left: 18.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">▶ 학생역량관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(BISKIT,</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">비스킷</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">비교과프로그램 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -0.8pt; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-left: 18.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- <a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">biskit.kumoh.ac.kr </font></u></a>-&gt; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">로그인 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-&gt; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">학습활동 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-&gt; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">교내비교과 신청</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
